  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Gundark</defName>
    <label>gundark</label>
    <description>Gundarks were fearsome anthropoids from the planet Vanqor. They were known as one of the most vicious, strong, and aggressive species in the galaxy. This ferocity resulted in them being exported across to many worlds as gladiatorial combatants or as exotic pets. They had two powerful arms used in combat and locomotion, two smaller arms for manipulation and walked on a specialised single clawed-toes. They famously had very large ears which aided in tracking and hunting prey; typically before an ambush.</description>
